            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electric work machine including:an electric motor having an external power supply and a battery as drive power sources; anda hydraulic actuator having, as a hydraulic pressure source, a hydraulic pump driven by the electric motor,the electric work machine being arranged to determine which power supply mode is selected andif the charging mode in which only the battery is charged by using the commercial power supply is selected as power supply mode,the connection of the power supply cable is configured to be checked,if it is determined that the power supply cable is "not connected", the system controller is arranged to issue an error,if it is determined that the power supply cable is "connected", the power supply relay is arranged to be turned on.</p>
            </abstract>
